  "name": "My Favorite No-Mayo Egg Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This no-mayo egg salad made with tahini, yogurt, and za'atar is a tasty Mediterranean-inspired twist on the traditional egg salad.",
